## SPEF FILE SIZE IMPACT

| Setting | SPEF Size Impact |
|---------|------------------|
| Coupling ON vs OFF | 3-5x larger |
| Lower threshold (0.01 vs 0.1) | 2-3x larger |
| Detailed vs Reduced R | 2-4x larger |
| Location info ON | +10-20% |
| More corners | Linear (+1x per corner) |

---

## EXTRACTION RUNTIME IMPACT

| Setting | Runtime Impact |
|---------|----------------|
| Coupling ON | 3-10x slower |
| Detailed resistance | 2-3x slower |
| Detailed capacitance | 1.5-2x slower |
| Lower thresholds | 1.5-3x slower |
| More threads | Near-linear speedup |
